{"id": "da524562-58aa-466c-b178-b34eeb789a87", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T19:00:55.194726", "source": "user", "parent_id": "e85705c2-329f-4ae6-a498-726b05a50a98", "llm_message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"cache_prompt": false, "type": "text", "text": "{\"researcher_request\": \"请进行初始检查工作。本次任务为设计类任务,核心问题是:零气泡流水线调度算法 ZB-2p 在多 GPU 上实测时,其气泡率是否真正接近于零。提示中已说明 ZB-2p 的启用方式(例如将 --zero-bubble-max-pending-backward 设为流水线阶段数的两倍),但这些仅为来源中的设定提示,具体实现细节需进一步确认。需要在初始阶段完成三件事:一、对工作区(/workspace)及任何可用的输入文件、文档、代码或仓库进行只读检查,列出与零气泡调度、ZB-2p、流水线并行(bubble rate、F-then-B、1F1B、P2P)等相关的可见资料;二、提出一个实现该设计目标的初步方案思路,涵盖受测假设、关键变量、实验组与对照组的设置思路,以及在多 GPU 环境下如何测量和定义“近零气泡率”;三、列出该方法所依赖的关键假设以及目前仍未解决的不确定项(例如 ZB-2p 调度器在何种模型(如 GPT 类 Transformer)与何种流水线条数/批次条件下成立、计时与同步方式、是否需要 warmup 排除、通信开销是否计入气泡、与非零气泡调度(如 1F1B、Interleaved 1F1B、ZB-H1)的对照方式等)。注意:当前阶段仅请求以上三项,不要给出完整设计方案、也不要执行任何实验或生成虚构结果。请明确标注信息来源和无法核实的部分。\", \"required_handoff_stage\": \"plan\", \"approach_approved\": false, \"public_task\": {\"question\": \"Does the automatic scheduling algorithm’s output (ZB-2p) truly achieve a near-zero bubble rate in practice when profiled on multiple GPUs? (Note: The ZB-2p schedule should be activated by setting the appropriate zero bubble configuration flag, for example --zero-bubble-max-pending-backward set to twice the number of pipeline stages.)\", \"context\": \"Design an experiment that answers the question. The researcher can clarify source-supported setup details by topic. Do not claim that an experiment was run.\", \"environment\": {\"runtime\": \"bubblewrap\", \"network\": \"disabled\", \"repository\": \"/workspace\", \"python\": \"python3\", \"software_environment\": \"system Python; project dependencies not preinstalled\", \"datasets\": [], \"gpu_enabled\": false, \"cpu_affinity_count\": 24, \"note\": \"Successful exploratory commands are not proof of a completed experiment.\"}, \"researcher_topics\": [], \"question_budget\": 6, \"actor_step_budget\": 60, \"continue_after_initial_plan\": false}}"}], "tool_calls": null, "tool_call_id": null, "name": null}, "llm_response_id": null, "activated_skills": [], "extended_content": [], "sender": null, "kind": "MessageEvent", "source_event_index": 1}
